# Secrets — never commit. This repo is a PUBLIC fork.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Source corpus — BIS standard PDFs are not ours to redistribute
data/pdfs/*
!data/pdfs/.gitkeep

# Prepared index snapshots.
#
# Gitignored on purpose, and the ~19 MB is only the reason. A snapshot is a
# derived artefact: anyone can rebuild one with `npm run index:export` from a
# machine that has the corpus. Committing a binary blob of someone else's
# standards' text into a public repo buys nothing and ages badly. Hand the
# directory over as a zip, a release asset or a drive instead.
index-snapshots/*
!index-snapshots/README.md

# Local artifacts
*.log
.DS_Store
